	// of the listed device_ids only), claiming one one-time EC and one
	// one-time Kyber pre-key of each device: a one-time pre-key is handed out
	// once, also to concurrent callers. Without a one-time Kyber pre-key the
	// last-resort one is returned; without a one-time EC pre-key the bundle
