	// encrypted with the user's history key of history_key_version, which
	// must be the current one (ERROR_REASON_E2E_HISTORY_KEY_STALE). Only a
	// paired device writes (ERROR_REASON_E2E_NOT_PAIRED). A message the
	// caller is not a party of, or a deleted one, is skipped; an entry that
	// exists stays as it is. accepted_message_ids are the given messages that
	// now have an entry of the caller.
