	// history key because the user has no paired device: the version goes up
	// by one and the device becomes paired. Older archive entries stay
	// unreadable to it. ERROR_REASON_E2E_PAIRED_DEVICE_EXISTS when another
	// paired device exists (pair by QR instead). A device that is paired
