	// scanning the QR code: answer is the user's history keys encrypted to
	// the new device's public key (opaque, 1 to 16384 bytes), and
	// history_key_version must be the current one. Another user's, expired,
	// answered or unknown requests are ERROR_REASON_E2E_LINK_REQUEST_NOT_FOUND.
